I can think of at least two interpretations
Do you mean something &quot;Currently, this document does not have a good definition of view states. Consequently, icons, the definitions of mode change events and view states are undefined.&quot;?
Re Section 2.2 - the sentence in the 3rd paragraph isn't complete. NB &quot;... separate widget instances to &quot;.
2.2 3rd: already changed, IIRC
but you're going to delete 2.2 (reference is version 1.6)?
Re Section 2.3 missing definitions for: the 4 VIEW_* constants, currentMode,  onModeChange, preferences, onbeforeupdate, onafterupdate, and hasFeature
Re Section 2.3 - Section 2.3 - is it a problem for this interface to have both WidgetIconCollection icons and Array icons?
Re Section 2.3 - duplicate definition of &quot;void setIcon(in DOMString url);&quot;
2.2 is going
gone
awesome!
Re Section 2.3 - definition of WidgetIconCollection is missing
2.3, yes
I might change that to just Array, though
(widgeticon
setIcon is a typo, because I was planning on allowing either a WidgetIcon object, or a URL
the VIEW_ constants: gone, and current mode has been defined to be a DOMString instead
onModeChange is getting a definition in line with what Mark Priestley has proposed
when will check-in your local changes, Arve?
4dd217ba7542bb00a127f682e2c3ad27: sometime tomorrow, I guess
please ping me after your checkin
I still have a lot of WidgetIconCollection is missing the 2.3 - the sentence in the 4d217ba7542'"}"")
